    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Techniques\" title=\"Force Techniques\">Force Techniques</a></i> </p><p>You can use the <i><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vital_Transfer\" title=\"Vital Transfer\">Vital Transfer</a></i> Force Power to treat a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Poison\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Poison\">Poison</a> affecting the target. Instead of the normal effects of the <i><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vital_Transfer\" title=\"Vital Transfer\">Vital Transfer</a></i> Force Power, you can compare the result of your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> check to the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Poisons\" title=\"Poisons\">Poison's</a> DC. If you equal or exceed the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Poisons\" title=\"Poisons\">Poison's</a> DC, you detoxify the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Poison\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Poison\">Poison</a> as per the use of the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Treat_Injury\" title=\"Treat Injury\">Treat Injury</a> Skill. </p>",
